OL,3,GNEWSABoy rescued after clinging to
OL,4,Acliff edge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy was rescued by emergency service
OL,7,Fcrews after he was found clinging to a
OL,8,Fgorse bush on a cliff edge above a 39ft
OL,9,F(12m) drop.
OL,11,FThe incident happened on the coast of
OL,12,FLaxey Bay at about 14:00 BST on Monday,
OL,13,Fthe Isle of Man Coastguard said.
OL,15,FThey were alerted by their team in the
OL,16,FMarine Operations Centre at the Sea
OL,17,FTerminal, saying "he was in danger of
OL,18,Ffalling, but managing to hold on to a
OL,19,Fgorse bush above a 12m drop".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
