OL,3,GNEWSABoy rescued after clinging to
OL,4,Acliff edge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters also attended and a ladder
OL,7,Fwas used to rescue the boy, said to be
OL,8,Fabout 12-years-old, and take him to
OL,9,Fsafety.
